<title>POLAND: NOVITA MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>NOVITA MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.12 vs   0.17</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.21 vs   0.15</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.29 vs   0.35</p>
<p> Sales		    5.12 vs   5.46</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.38 vs   0.32</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.09 vs   0.37</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.54 vs   1.00</p>
<p> Sales		   15.87 vs  14.01</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish carpet maker is Novita SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
